This application uses MiSans by Xiaomi. The original font software has its own
MiSans license and is not relicensed under Apache-2.0. Its license and notice
are supplied under frontend/public/fonts/ (and the built app's fonts/).
The unmodified static WOFF2 font slices are fetched from Xiaomi during
setup/build with SHA-256 verification against misans-manifest.json; the source
repository does not redistribute the font binaries.
Official source: https://hyperos.mi.com/font/zh/

Provider icons from LobeHub retain their MIT license in
 demo/assets/providers/LOBEHUB-LICENSE.

The embedding container downloads BAAI/bge-small-zh-v1.5 at revision
7999e1d3359715c523056ef9478215996d62a620. Its model card declares MIT.
The weights are converted to ONNX (model.onnx) at build time without changes
to their values; vector parity with the original model is checked during export.
See deploy/licenses/bge-small-zh-v1.5-LICENSE and that container's model folder.
Model source: https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-zh-v1.5
Other software dependencies retain their respective licenses.

